            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "runs": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Back in Belgium, the scientists looked at the ants under an electronic microscope and found that their 31, triangular hair reflects light like a prism (棱镜)，giving them a metallic reflection and protecting them from the sun's awful heat. When Ph.D. student Quentin Will not 32 the hair from an ant with a 33 knife and put it under a heat lamp, its temperature jumped."
